We’ve been using the old Hathor {Location1|Address} and {Location2|Address} as stashes, but it turns out some over-eager nullbrains sniffed them out and are trying to boost our shit for their own.

Luckily, the goods are still there - for now. We need someone to visit that PAF and OLP, grab our stuff from the freight elevators, and take it to the freight elevator at {Destination|Address} where we should be able to keep it on ice.

Here’s the list of what to grab. Don’t care what order you do ‘em in. Be sure to bring a ship that can store 32 SCU at the very least.

- Freight elevator at {Location|Address}
- Freight elevator at {Location1|Address}
- Freight elevator at {Location2|Address}

Make sure you’re ready to deal with whatever assholes you run across. A handheld tractor beam would also be smart to bring along.

Stows out.

Attention:

Rights to a new Salvage Claim are available for purchase. Exclusive access to the ship’s verified coordinates in monitored space will be provided upon confirmed credit transfer. The coordinates will remain accessible as long as the accepted contract is active. When you are satisfied with the amount of material you've salvaged, you may abandon the contract early with no penalty to clear the coordinates from your Starmap.

Claim #{ClaimNumber}:
• SHIP: {Ship}
• CAUSE OF ACCIDENT: {ShipStory}
• LOCATION: {location}

Adagio Rights Division

We've got a shipment of contraband that needs to be hauled to a couple of different places. If you like creds, head to {Location|Address}, load everything up, and bring it to these drop points:

DROP OFF LOCATIONS (ANY ORDER)

- Freight elevator at {Destination|Address}
- Freight elevator at {Destination1|Address}
- Freight elevator at {Destination2|Address}

You're gonna need a handheld tractor beam to move the boxes and enough room in your cargo hold for size 2 SCU containers.

Avoid other ships if you can. Security will bust you if they figure out what you're hauling, and raiders will just take it for themselves.

-Twitch

One of our best distributors got busted in Stanton so we need a replacement. The guy was an incredible salesman, but a shit smuggler. We need someone who won't run face-first into a security patrol or a pack of pirates to pick up some merchandise at these locations:

PICK UP LOCATIONS (ANY ORDER)

- Freight elevator at {Location|Address}
- Freight elevator at {Location1|Address}

And bring it all to {Destination|Address} before security catches on to what's happening. You'll need enough space on your ship for size 2 SCU containers, and a handheld tractor beam should make loading and unloading nice and easy.

-Twitch

If you've got a fast ship, can discreetly carry size 8 SCU containers, and love getting a huge payout, we need you to head to {Location|Address} immediately and take what you find there to these drop points:

DROP OFF LOCATIONS (ANY ORDER)

- Freight elevator at {Destination|Address}
- Freight elevator at {Destination1|Address}

The buyers are paying a premium to get their hands on fresh stormwal meat. Stay sharp. If security catches you with this, it's your ass on the line. If you're smart, you'll use a handheld tractor beam to get everything loaded up quick.

-Twitch
